## Error Handling

### Service Exceptions
- Create custom exception classes
- Implement proper error messages
- Handle service-specific errors
- Use appropriate HTTP status codes

```php
// Good: Custom service exceptions
class CourseServiceException extends Exception
{
    public static function courseNotFound(int $id): self
    {
        return new self("Course with ID {$id} not found");
    }
    
    public static function courseNotPublished(Course $course): self
    {
        return new self("Course '{$course->title}' is not published");
    }
}
```

### Error Recovery
- Implement retry mechanisms
